{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15235080","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15235080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1523508001:0":{"text":"呼……总算……总算捡回了一条命……","source_cn":"呼……总算……总算捡回了一条命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D72767AF9B0C250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1523508002:1":{"text":"呼临城……真是太可怕了！早知道战争后呼临城大乱，我就不该来的……","source_cn":"呼临城……真是太可怕了！早知道战争后呼临城大乱，我就不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBC7F9DD83857A99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1523508003:0":{"text":"咳嗯……外来的学者，你好！我是呼临城的领主。","source_cn":"咳嗯……外来的学者，你好！我是呼临城的领主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D522105B6CFA037","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1523508004:1":{"text":"关于之前提到的苦苞穗改良的研究，所有的资料、种子和实验用的农田，我们都已经准备好。","source_cn":"关于之前提到的苦苞穗改良的研究，所有的资料、种子和实验...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C687E34882A36BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1523508005:1":{"text":"如果你愿意的话，随时可以开始研究！","source_cn":"如果你愿意的话，随时可以开始研究！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22AEF6023ECE524B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1523508006:1":{"text":"不——我不愿意！","source_cn":"不——我不愿意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21A7B619640F8734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1523508007:1":{"text":"很好！呼临城会以最高待遇……啊？你、你不愿意？","source_cn":"很好！呼临城会以最高待遇……啊？你、你不愿意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6892F2AA1BF40943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1523508008:1":{"text":"我刚到你们呼临城，就被那个谋逆的家伙绑架，差点丢了性命……谁会想待在这里啊？！","source_cn":"我刚到你们呼临城，就被那个谋逆的家伙绑架，差点丢了性命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788E46E142F72034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1523508009:1":{"text":"你说的那个研究我不想做了，我现在只想回希莱城！","source_cn":"你说的那个研究我不想做了，我现在只想回希莱城！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EF8A6500247834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1523508010:1":{"text":"希莱城……等等，你是<style=\"highlight\">扎莱</style>吗？","source_cn":"希莱城……等等，你是<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3B01C3CC6A9B8ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1523508011:1":{"text":"……你认识我？","source_cn":"……你认识我？","status"